  "raw_label": "postponed_or_procedural",
  "texts": {
    "preamble": "Del Monte Foods Pvt. Ltd vs Addl. District Magistrate Budgam And ... on 20 March, 2024 Author: Wasim Sadiq Nargal Bench: Wasim Sadiq Nargal S. No. 119 Regular Cause List In The High C0Urt 0F Jammu & Kashmir And Ladakh At Srinagar Wp (C) No. 2897/2023 Cm No. 6897/2023 Cm No. 6898/2023 Cm No. 834/2024 Del Monte Foods Pvt. Ltd. ...Appellant/Petitioner(s) Through: None Vs. Addl. District Magistrate Budgam and Ors. ...Respondent(s) Through: Mr. Satinder Singh Kala, AAG CORAM: HON'BLE MR. JUSTICE WASIM SADIQ NARGAL, JUDGE ORDER 20.03.2024 CM(834/2024) This is an application by the Respondent No. 2, seeking transfer of the writ petition WP(C) 2897/2023 to the Food Safety Appellate Tribunal.",
    "facts": "",
    "arguments": "Mr. Satinder Singh Kala, the learned Additional Advocate General submits that the Government has issued a notification dated 15th December, 2023, being S.O 616, in exercise of the power conferred under sub-section (3) of Section 70 of the Food Safety & Standards, Act 2006 read with Rule 3.2.1 of the Food Safety & Standards Rules, 2011 and accordingly, appointed the following Presiding Officers for Food Safety Appellate Tribunal, Kashmir and Food Safety Appellate Tribunal, Jammu. Jurisdiction Presiding Officer Kashmir Shri. Shujat Al Khan S/O Usman Ali Khan R/O Village Naloosa, Tehsil Boniyar Sub Division Uri, District Baramulla. Jammu Shri Ramesh Kumar Wattal S/O Lt. Shri Jagar Nath Wattal R/O House No. 69, Durga Nagar Enclave Sector,1 Jammu. Del Monte Foods Pvt. Ltd vs Addl. District Magistrate Budgam And ... on 20 March, 2024 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/7981440/ 1 Mr. Satinder Singh Kala, the learned Additional Advocate General submits that in the light of the notification issued by the Government, this Court lacks inherent jurisdiction to adjudicate the instant writ petition any further and as such, the instant writ petition needs to be transferred to the Food Safety Appellate Tribunal, Kashmir, for adjudication."
  },
